            <li><a href="https://translate.google.com/translate?sl=en&amp;tl=ko&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bergencountyclerk.gov%2FElections" lang="ko" hreflang="ko" data-bcc-lang="ko" rel="noopener">&#54620;&#44397;&#50612;</a></li>
